      LessonBlock.example("A pair of scissors is lying on the table.", note: "Scissors plural hai, lekin a pair of ke sath verb singular ata hai, kyunke asal subject pair hai, scissors nahi."),
      LessonBlock.heading("Ye kahan kaam aata hai"),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Rozmarra zindagi me jahan ginna ho, kharidari ho ya koi fehrist banana ho, har jagah plural chalta hai. Two books, three days, many students. Daftari aur sarkari angrezi me bhi yehi haal hai. Reports aur applications me likha hota hai ke the documents are attached, ya all candidates must bring their certificates."),
