      LessonBlock.trap("He behaved friendly with the guests.", "He behaved in a friendly way with the guests.", "friendly adjective hai, adverb nahi. Aise alfaaz ke sath in a friendly way kehna parta hai."),
      LessonBlock.trap("She writes very careful.", "She writes very carefully.", "likhne ke kaam ki khoobi hai, carefully ayega."),
