          explanation: "Hardly pehle se negative matlab rakhta hai, do not ki zaroorat nahi.",
        ),
        LessonMcq(
          question: "She will not ___ the party.",
          options: <String>["attends", "attended", "attend", "attending"],
          correctIndex: 2,
          explanation: "Attend. Will not ke baad main verb V1 me ata hai.",
